2026-07-27T10:50:32.7890555Z i /tmp/Rtmp6cV1aU/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:50:32.7890953Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:50:32.7891444Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:50:32.7891865Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:50:32.7892508Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:50:32.7893452Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:50:32.7894489Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
